21:["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-ink/85","children":["Crunchyroll"," — ","Streaming anime berlisensi global dengan katalog musiman yang luas."," Developer: ","Crunchyroll, LLC",". Harga: ","Sebagian konten dapat gratis dengan iklan; akses penuh dan banyak episode terbaru memerlukan langganan Premium berbayar",". Penilaian keamanan lengkapnya, termasuk izin yang diminta dan risikonya, ada di bagian “Apakah ","Crunchyroll"," Aman?” di bawah."]}]
